   948	to the identity \ref{almThm2.3} and recalling \eqref{p6}, we see that the sums
   949	   $$3x^2+2y(y+1)+\f{z(3z+1)}2\ \quad  \text{and}\,\quad 2x(x+1)+\f{y(3y+1)}2+z(3z+2),$$
   950	    are almost universal in light of the first and second terms of the right-hand side of \eqref{almThm2.3}.
